{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：东京电子1Q业务与近期数据观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">东京电子（Tokyo Electron,8035.T）在7月30日收盘后公布了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>财年<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>业绩。营业利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2114亿</span>日元，与GS预测的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2150亿</span>日元及彭博一致预期基本持平，但<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">46.8%</span>的毛利率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">高于预期</span>，从盈利质量角度看留下积极印象。这份财报更值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的信号来自指引：上半年营业利润指引从4310亿日元上调至4580亿日元，高于此前预测和市场共识。管理层虽未披露全年指引，但明确表示下半年增长将显著超过上半年，全年营业利润达到1万亿日元已进入视野——彭博一致预期目前不到9500亿日元。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS认为，这一展望足以满足市场的高预期。报告同时将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>财年营业利润预测从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9140亿</span>日元上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10224亿</span>日元，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028</span>财年从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13603亿</span>日元上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14981亿</span>日元。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOU6SvFAImhhphK4q022VppuC0VI9C2zQkZicWlAyoiaiaa9lIctmria55xm0T1iavuqfKxyfU9mXz088iamQBU37EFKjqic0XjSVWcv4c/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">DRAM与存储行业技术应用观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">东京电子在业绩说明会上给出了对晶圆制造设备（WFE）市场的判断：<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>日历年度市场将保持超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20%</span>的同比增长，规模超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1500亿美元</span>；<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>日历年度进一步超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1900亿美元</span>。管理层同时表示，增速仍有进一步扩大的空间。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">公司目标是在先进制程设备研究<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>中实现超过WFE市场的销售增长。与三个月前相比，公司对先进封装设备和DRAM布线工艺蚀刻设备的销售预期有所上调。产能方面，公司已根据客户未来两年的预测建立了能够满足需求的框架。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">KC评论</span>：</strong> 这里的关键不是WFE市场本身增长多少，而是东京电子对自身增速超过市场增速的确认。先进封装和DRAM布线设备预期上调，说明公司认为自己在这些细分领域的份额仍在扩大，而非仅仅跟随行业周期。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXT9ibaKkpibTwic9RqCYMfaAZdUHR2p1XhR0apX54E4Axpt5tUjo6juYRA9FYQibAlT3QPh4kqnKYT2Ndic1qBDA8BTTYhC6wicpLR4/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 定价优化从4Q起显现，毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>目标可能提前实现</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">盈利能力是这份财报中超出预期的部分。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">46.8%</span>，高于市场预期。管理层正在推进定价优化，预计从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>财年<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>起看到明显效果。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">关于未来两年内实现<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>以上毛利率的目标，公司表示正在采取措施，争取在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028</span>财年初期就达到这一水平。GS预测模型显示，毛利率将从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>财年的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">45.3%</span>逐步升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>财年的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">47.3%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028</span>财年的49.8%，2029财年达到51.1%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">从季度路径看，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>财年<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">46.8%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">46.5%</span>，三季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">47.0%</span>，四季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48.6%</span>——呈现逐季抬升的形态。这与管理层关于定价优化效果从四季度开始显现的表述相互印证。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUrKZT629ibxKQwPsY31uNszF0dOOQOchuqVbYxekpu2oJwuib3SFqlCZia1iaYibU1RDJCric4Dr4TlKOibYHkJibnz2jRJefQ0euElZo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3.营业业务与季度数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS对东京电子的季度营业利润率预测呈现清晰的上升轨迹：<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>财年一季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28.9%</span>，二季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">29.3%</span>，三季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">29.8%</span>，四季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">31.9%</span>。全年营业利润率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>财年的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25.6%</span>提升至30.0%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">收入端同样呈现下半年<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>的格局。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7324亿</span>日元，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9020亿</span>日元，三季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8420亿</span>日元，四季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9262亿</span>日元。下半年合计收入预计超过上半年，与管理层关于下半年增长显著超过上半年的表述一致。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXVM6o8I14kOhMj1ywwUPESaAnkCfZxIJwicDsMYqCw5D4xBicSeOSKATmITJ7wDy0SU4hXRFC67pG3ANb2DgRFSCpvSHtUdoCEc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 48-GS-Tokyo Electron -8035.T-Earnings Review- 1Q in line- but stronger outlook from 2Q brings FY3 27 operating profits of -1 tn into view- margin improvemen</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
